OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to help people quit
OL,4,Asmoking
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new regional campaign has been
OL,7,Flaunched to help people quit smoking
OL,8,Fpermanently.
OL,10,FThe What Will You Miss? campaign has
OL,11,Fbeen launched by Smokefree South West,
OL,12,Fa partnership of 15 local authorities
OL,13,Fworking alongside the NHS.
OL,15,FIn Cornwall, it is hoped it would
OL,16,Fencourage smokers to take the first
OL,17,Fstep towards quitting and access free
OL,18,Flocal support.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
