OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to help people quit
OL,4,Asmoking
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Thalia Marrington, cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for community safety and public
OL,8,Fhealth at Cornwall Council, said: "Up
OL,9,Fto two in three smokers die around 10
OL,10,Fyears early, unless they quit."
